<title>USA: Brazos Sportswear sells $100 mln 144A notes.</title>
<headline>Brazos Sportswear sells $100 mln 144A notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144a debt issue from Brazos Sportswear Inc was priced Thursday via lead manager Dillion Read &amp; Co Inc, according to a syndicate official.</p>
<p>Brazos Sportswear is headquartered in Cincinnati, Ohio, and is principally a domestic designer, manufacturer, and markerter of decorated sportswear.</p>
<p>BORROWER BRAZOS SPORTSWEAR INC</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 10.50 PCT  MATURITY 7/1/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 99.24   FIRST PAY DATE 1/1/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B2    YIELD 10.625 PCT  PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-PLUS			    CALLABLE  NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678 ))</p>
